## Interface: 120007
## Title: AutoMailer Continued
## Author: RainForDays, Tharavol, MAI-Code-1-Flash, Claude
## Notes: Automatically mail items.
## Version: @project-version@
## X-License: GPL-3.0-only
## DefaultState: enabled
## SavedVariablesPerCharacter: AutoMailer
## SavedVariables: AutoMailerGlobal

## X-ReleaseNotes: Adds a "Send Mail" button to the mailbox that automatically mails items out of your bags and can be run again as many times as you like. Configure your rules in two tables: "Items to AutoMail" for rules that match one specific item, each row showing its icon, name, a Retain count and its own recipient (blank recipient falls back to your default Recipient), built by shift-clicking or dragging items straight from your bags; and "Name Matches" for rules that match by text, so a rule for Ore mails every ore. Retain sets how many of a matched item to leave in your bags instead of mailing all of them, counted across every bag (0, the default, mails everything). Optionally auto-mail all crafting reagents, and optionally auto-mail BoE items (with optional level/rarity limits) to a separate BoE Recipient. Optionally mails gold above a configurable threshold to your Recipient, automatically accounting for mail postage so your balance lands exactly on the threshold. Mails up to 12 attachments per letter and continues automatically through every batch/recipient. Shift-click a bag item while the options panel is open to add it to your list; shift-clicking while the mailbox is open to auto-start a send run is now an opt-in setting, and a run that would send gold can optionally ask for confirmation first ("Ask before sending gold", off by default). Supports an optional global profile shared across all characters, toggleable debug logging (/am debug or the options checkbox), and /am / /automailer to open options (/am list recaps what's been sent this session).

AutoMailerTemplates.xml
# Must stay first: every module below captures A.L at file scope.
Locale.lua
Core.lua
Profile.lua
MailQueue.lua
Send.lua
OptionsPanel.lua
AutoMailer.lua
